<title>USA: Oscar nominations for best actress.</title>
<headline>Oscar nominations for best actress.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The actresses nominated on Tuesday for the Academy Award for best leading role were Brenda Blethyn for &quot;Secrets &amp; Lies&quot;, Diane Keaton for &quot;Marvin's Room&quot;, Frances McDormand for &quot;Fargo&quot;, Kristin Scott Thomas for &quot;The English Patient&quot;, and Emily Watson for &quot;Breaking the Waves&quot;.</p>
</text>
